**Tickets** 0.1.3 is the first published release: a local-first issue tracker
for turning "I should fix that" into a saved task. File a ticket in its local
browser UI or terminal TUI, then copy a composed prompt. With a supported local
terminal and coding agent configured, a ticket can also open that agent on the
task in the selected repo.

